{"id": "093bd3bd03c2295bae969e04ec49dbff", "text": "Lord Hrishikesha (Krishna) sounded Panchajanya, Dhananjaya \n(Arjuna) sounded Devadatta , and v aliant Vrukodara (Bheema) sounded \nPowndra. (1.15)  \n \nKing Yudhishtira, son of Kunti, sounded Anantavijaya, and Nakula  \nand Sahadeva sounded Sughosha  and Manipushpaka,  respectively. (1.16)  \n \nThe King of Kashi an expert bowman, Shikhandi a great warrior on \nchari ot, Dhrushtadyumna, Virata and Satyaki, unbeaten in a war, all \nsounded their respective conch shells. (1.17)", "embedding": [-0.0658002644777298, 0.04857843741774559, -0.0135580375790596, -0.06206980720162392, -0.09114399552345276, -0.0058759781531989574, 0.03700734302401543, -0.02538726106286049, -0.059709515422582626, 0.02581954002380371, -0.039942290633916855, -0.15146273374557495, 0.06002515181899071, -0.08085311204195023, 0.01118226908147335, -0.021511761471629143, 0.004541139584034681, 0.07244152575731277, 0.011864331550896168, -0.09093884378671646, -0.062165312469005585, 0.10591951757669449, -0.022048983722925186, -0.003635342698544264, 0.04848477989435196, -0.027699921280145645, 0.009360714815557003, -0.0021454261150211096, -0.00546821765601635, -0.027810923755168915, -0.021715009585022926, -0.0713367611169815, 0.03679923340678215, -0.025191105902194977, -0.054102823138237, 0.054274171590805054, -0.03976494073867798, 0.07500655204057693, 0.026874372735619545, -0.038430485874414444, -0.022930936887860298, 0.05307833477854729, 0.027242328971624374, -0.08549239486455917, 0.0045881327241659164, -0.01890520565211773, -0.11536988615989685, -0.1068364679813385, 0.040263403207063675, 0.028071772307157516, -0.04110737890005112, -0.04784747585654259, 0.10034643858671188, 0.06705132126808167, 0.08144637197256088, -0.06941591948270798, -0.021593930199742317, 0.014587678015232086, 0.06276632845401764, 0.04573182761669159, -0.06036202982068062, 0.010247825644910336, -0.0026107970625162125, -0.060009121894836426, 0.009430505335330963, -0.11583200097084045